# unseen servant (usv)

one folder of writing, served to six networks at once. no build step. nothing executed, ever.

=> networks.gmi new to the small internet? start here: the field guide

## the plate

version: 1.0.1, released 2026-08-30, signed (minisign)
licence: MIT
author: human architected, AI coded. independent audit: none yet
needs: 256 MiB, no database, no root

=> artifacts.gmi packages: cloudron · deb · rpm · aur · nix · oci · tarball
=> addresses.gmi networks: gemini · titan · gopher · spartan · nex · finger · web
=> lineage.gmi lineage: agate · molly brown · gmcapsule · gmid · the gopher line

## capabilities

=> limits.gmi uploads: titan on the gemini port, gated by client certificate
=> limits.gmi zones: certificate-gated, walled off from every cleartext tree
=> limits.gmi render: on write, under two seconds; the html tree is portable
=> agents.gmi agents: first class. certificate identity, no secrets, json throughout
=> limits.gmi refuses: cgi · scripts · proxy · admin panel · visitor logs

